# T-Shirt Shopping Web App

A full-stack e-commerce web application for browsing T-shirts, managing products, and placing orders online. The application also includes an admin panel for product management and email notifications when a new order is placed.

## 🚀 Features

### 👕 Customer Module

- Browse available T-shirts
- View product details
- Add products to cart
- Place orders with customer details
- Enter delivery address and contact information
- Order confirmation

### 🔐 Admin Module

- Admin login
- Add new T-shirts
- Manage available products
- View products stored in the database
- Receive email notifications when a new order is placed

### 📦 Order Management

- Capture customer name, contact, and delivery address
- Store order details
- Calculate order total
- Generate unique order ID
- Send order notification to admin through email

